together through social interaction, creativity, entertainment, and meaningful connections. Our mission is to provide an environment where individuals can express themselves authentically while encouraging respectful communication and community participation.\n\n**Explore RAW Social Features**\n\n**Social Feed:** Discover posts, share your thoughts, and connect with community members.\n\n**Photos:** Share visual moments, explore creative content, and discover photography from the community.\n\n**Watch:** Enjoy video content and explore entertainment shared across the platform.\n\n**Rooms:** Join community spaces, participate in discussions, and connect with people who share similar interests.\n\n**Messaging:** Communicate with other members through the platform's messaging features.\n\n**RAW Games:** Explore interactive entertainment, including simulation, fashion, music, card, browser, and retro games. Some games may include advertisements.\n\n**A Community Built Around Inclusion**\n\nRAW Social emphasizes accessibility, neurodivergent inclusion, mental health awareness, and creating a more welcoming online experience.\n\nWhether you're a creator, artist, gamer, entrepreneur, or someone looking for meaningful connections, RAW Social provides opportunities to discover, share, and participate.\n\nVisit https://rawsocial.net to learn more ", "short_description": "RAW Social is a social networking platform built for authentic expression, meaningful connections, and safer online experiences. Explore personalized feeds, photos, videos, messaging, community rooms, and interactive games, with a focus on inclusion, creativity, and digital well-being."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://rawsocial.net/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://rawsocial.net/terms", "publisher_name": "Pocahontas Music LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://rawsocial.net/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST"